  "schema:name": "2.0 Adverse Event Reporting and Safety Signals",
  "schema:description": "Capability designed to securely capture, log, and classify any untoward, undesirable medical occurrence in a patient after they have received a medical product, regardless of whether the product is suspected of causing the event\r\n\r\nExample: Thorough tracking of patient visit records, communication platform to allow patients to contact health-care providers in the case of adverse events",
